1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
A grid with no numbers yet...

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:06,000
just cages, and a target inside each one!

3
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:10,020
This is Calcudoku!

4
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:13,740
Fill every cage so its numbers combine to match the clue!

5
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:18,080
This cage says three plus...

6
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,980
one and two make three!

7
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:25,280
This cage says six times...

8
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:29,560
two times three makes six — cage solved!

9
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:36,140
No repeats in any row or column — every cage has to work out too!

10
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:41,840
Parents — this builds arithmetic and logic, working together!

11
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:49,560
Tap Math Game Zone, crack open Calcudoku, pick your level, and crack the cages!

12
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:56,280
Abacus Kids — free right now on the App Store and Google Play!
